{"packetId":"packet-req-5-1-2","cases":[{"id":"view-public-issue-detail","requirementIds":["REQ-5-1-2"],"purpose":"happy_path","expectationBasis":["An issue detail page is the read view for a uniquely numbered work item within a repository — the top displays the number, a heading whose exact accessible name is the complete title without the issue number, and visible status text “Open” or “Closed”; the body displays the complete saved description as readable text; the right side displays assignees, labels, and milestone; and the bottom displays sections or records containing “Comment” or “Activity” text over time.","The seeded open issue title is `Improve onboarding` and its description is `Describe the onboarding improvement.`","THEN: The detail page displays the repository-scoped issue number, title, Open status, description, label, assignee, comment author, and comment body, and displays creation and comment activities in chronological order."],"steps":[{"op":"goto","path":"/"},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"acme-docs","exact":true,"fallbacks":[{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"acme-docs","exact":false},{"by":"text","text":"acme-docs","exact":true}]}},{"op":"expectVisible","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Issues","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Issues","exact":true}},{"op":"expectVisible","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Improve onboarding","exact":true}},{"op":"click","locator":{"by":"role","role":"link","name":"Improve onboarding","exact":true}},{"op":"expectVisible","locator":{"by":"text","text":"Describe the onboarding improvement.","exact":true}},{"op":"expectText","locator":{"by":"text","text":"Open","exact":true},"text":"Open","exact":true},{"op":"expectText","locator":{"by":"text","text":"bug","exact":false},"text":"bug","exact":false},{"op":"expectText","locator":{"by":"text","text":"documentation","exact":false},"text":"documentation","exact":false},{"op":"expe